5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I want to see how things actually work on the ground! I'll check the yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial, plus the depot calendar and the peak-season cutover.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I am concerned about the long-term financial commitments. I will examine the five years of renewal invoices and the board minutes on capital and operating requests.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I will look into support ownership during last winter's outage and the depot supervisors and the last rollout. I want to see how accountability and planning held up under pressure.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to see if things are getting old and dusty! I'll check the upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the data lift in the 2018 pay move. Let's see what happened!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I shall focus on the human element of our operations. I will examine the administrator retirements and hiring times, as well as the depot supervisors and the last rollout.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
